    "enUS": {
      "description": "Sifting through the loose dirt, the severed hand of an orc is found.  And clutched in the hand is a bone-carved tube.  And in the tube is a dirt-stained parchment.\n\nThe parchment is written in orcish... and it looks important.",
      "summary": "Bring the Spy's Report to a Theramore Lieutenant.",
      "title": "The Orc Report",
